  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Finely chop onion and garlic. <br>• Pick and finely chop rosemary.<br>• Trim green beans, then slice into thirds. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e603c6fc0ca5e036e07ac2/step-a837fd00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat half the butter and a <br>drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook onion and sliced mushrooms, stirring, <br>until tender and browned, 6-8 minutes. <br>• Add garlic, rosemary and risotto-style rice. <br>Cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e603c6fc0ca5e036e07ac2/step-658e2410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add the water, vegetable stock and <br>garlic &amp; herb seasoning to the pan, then bring <br>to the boil.<br>• Transfer risotto to a baking dish. Cover tightly <br>with foil. Bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is <br>‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes. <br>• When the risotto has 10 minutes remaining, <br>remove from oven. Stir through green beans, <br>then return to oven to bake until tender.</p> <p><br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly <br>firm in the centre.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e603c6fc0ca5e036e07ac2/step-92beb520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the risotto is baking, thinly slice cucumber<br>into half-moons. <br>• In a medium bowl combine the honey with <br>a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. <br>Season with salt and pepper. <br>• Add rocket leaves and cucumber. Toss to coat. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e603c6fc0ca5e036e07ac2/step-fa1dce30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When risotto is ready, remove from oven <br>and stir through half the Parmesan cheese and <br>the remaining butter. <br>• Season to taste. </p> <p><br>TIP: Stir through a splash of water to loosen the <br>risotto, if needed. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e603c6fc0ca5e036e07ac2/step-ad875740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide baked mushroom and rosemary risotto <br>between bowls.<br>• Sprinkle over remaining Parmesan and serve <br>with rocket salad. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e603c6fc0ca5e036e07ac2/step-127c4f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
